@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@documentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@knowledgeBaseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 上传：先创建知识库，将 id 填到上面；首次返回 201，再次上传同内容返回 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{knowledgeBaseId}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RagBoundary

--RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ./sample.md
--RagBoundary--

### 文档列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{knowledgeBaseId}}/documents?page=0&size=20

### 文档详情：将上传返回的 id 填入上面的 documentId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}
